# Shell completion

Forgejo uses the `urfave.org/cli/v3` package for building the command line interface.
As such, we automatically benefit from [urfave's shell completions](https://cli.urfave.org/v3/examples/completions/shell-completions/),
which support `bash`, `zsh`, `fish` and `powershell`/`pwsh`.

To generate the shell completion files, run `forgejo completion <shell>` and replace `<shell>` with one of the four values:

- `bash`
- `zsh`
- `fish`
- `pwsh`
